codex
The invariant is now: with accumulated sequence `ACC` in the one result heap object and remaining input `REM`, the real loop terminates with that heap object containing `incrAcc(ACC, REM)`. The recursive summary consumes one constructor per loop step and records the exact frozen-semantics term `applyBin("+", element, 1)`; it does not skip execution.
apply patch
